Z||000000||SpeedPhreak||11-28-1999||04:11 PM||||ok i switched to atf & can already feel the difference in the feel.  i bled per v8 archie & the rod moves at the first sign of pedal pressure so i am confident that its done right.  so whats the prob u ask?<P>it wont start!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>i turn it on. the fuel pump primes.  the gauges seem to do what there supposed to except for the volts...no movement.  then i turn the key & nothin.  so no big deal i figure that the battery is dead since i havent started it for about 4 weeks.  so my brother gets out the jumper cables... still nothing from the voltmeter & nothin from the starter.  ok so i figure the little plastic slide thing on the clutch is in the wrong possition (it happend before) so i push it all the way in & push the clutch down & it moves to the right spot & nothin.  so i have my brother try & start it & the only thing happening is the clutch rod moving & a very faint click from somewhere in the center/back of the engine????<P>n e 1 know whats up??<P>thanx <BR>speedphreak<P>||||reg||8
