Z||000002||Patrick||11-28-1999||04:28 PM||||<BR>Glad to hear you've converted to <B>ATF</B>... <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Regarding your starting problem, this may seem like a simplified answer, but sometimes jumper cables will just not do the trick. Take the battery right out of your brother's car, connect it up properly in your Fiero, and try it again. You may be surprised!||||reg||14
